CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'fc->corrupt_bio_rw == READ'
#87: FILE: drivers/md/dm-flakey.c:326:
+	if (fc->corrupt_bio_byte && !error && bio_submitted_while_down &&
 	    (bio_data_dir(bio) == READ) && (fc->corrupt_bio_rw == READ) &&
 	    all_corrupt_bio_flags_match(bio, fc))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

